{"contract":"ldvh-helper-cli/2","response_profile":"compact","request_kind":"call","operation_key":"find-fact-object-candidates","outcome":"ok","summary":"已形成当前事实恢复清单与确定性候选卡","result":{"recovery_manifest":{"governed_project_id":"ldvh","git_worktree_root":"/Users/dmh2002/poker_hud_projects/ld-vibe-harness-v4/.cindy-worktrees/swift-mendel","git_common_dir":"/Users/dmh2002/poker_hud_projects/ld-vibe-harness-v4/.git","schema_fingerprint":"a8fced24db8b77d2784c9657f756ee526e1e96b6a1be2fc96a810204471a1f9d","object_set_fingerprint":"1e7ccdc9c63cd992f4e919a31961e0a675f30c8b6841684aec0d114ab74dfc75","counts":[{"fact_type_key":"adr","status":"active","count":5},{"fact_type_key":"adr","status":"retired","count":3},{"fact_type_key":"pitfall","status":"active","count":6},{"fact_type_key":"pitfall","status":"discarded","count":2},{"fact_type_key":"pitfall","status":"draft","count":0},{"fact_type_key":"spark","status":"discarded","count":17},{"fact_type_key":"spark","status":"implemented","count":64},{"fact_type_key":"spark","status":"open","count":4},{"fact_type_key":"study","status":"active","count":21},{"fact_type_key":"study","status":"retired","count":16},{"fact_type_key":"workcase","status":"blocked","count":0},{"fact_type_key":"workcase","status":"closed","count":134},{"fact_type_key":"workcase","status":"open","count":1}],"current_workcase_ref":null,"selected_fact_refs":[],"invalid_objects":[],"unavailable_objects":[]},"cards":[{"fact_ref":{"object_uid":"019ffb52-ebb5-705a-aa9b-e2ac31dfc7cb"},"card_layer":"F2","fields":{"object_uid":"019ffb52-ebb5-705a-aa9b-e2ac31dfc7cb","object_id":"pitfall-01KZXN5TXNE1DAN6Z2NGRXZHYB","title":"独立入口契约真空致首选规则引导入口被放弃","status":"active","symptoms":"调用方按技能指引调用 ldvh-work-context 首选规则引导入口时，先撞参数错误、再撞 stdin 契约缺失提示；随后在 capabilities 与 Helper 服务规范（04）中反复查找事件形状无果（十几次 find/grep/试调），自行构造调用时 shell 引号失败，最终放弃首选入口、退回降级路径；全过程耗时约为修复后正常路径的三倍。识别信号：会话记录中出现对同一入口的多次试错调用，且最终回答声明“首选 unavailable、改用降级路径”。","trigger_conditions":"前置条件组合：（1）需要经 ldvh-work-context、ldvh-doctor 等独立入口完成调用（它们不是 Helper 操作）；（2）调用方持有的指引把“调用信封与参数”的权威统一指向 capabilities 与 04；（3）该入口的调用契约实际只登记在环境接入面附件（09.Att.01）对应入口行；（4）指引未把调用方指向该附件。已观察条件：薄 Skill 会话中按指引现取参数时必然命中。未知条件：其它 AI 环境 adapter 手工接入同一入口时是否同样命中，未逐一验证。","scope_of_impact":"与 LDVH 独立（非 Helper）入口的调用、指引编写或契约定位相关的工作；薄 Skill 规则引导","applicability":"适用边界：LDVH 薄 Skill 接入的各 AI 环境中，凡需调用 ldvh-work-context、ldvh-doctor、ldvh-context-recovery、ldvh-git-commit-msg 等独立（非 Helper）入口的场景，以及为任何新独立入口编写或修订调用指引的场景。观察环境：macOS 桌面 Kimi 环境、0.1.0 本地发行物、修复后模板。不适用：Helper 操作本身的参数发现（capabilities/04 已覆盖）；入口实现内部的逻辑问题。","validation_summary":"已观察结果：修复前探针（17.7 分钟、31 次 Bash 调用、首选入口零成功、降级路径兜底、一次越界临时文件自建自删）；修复后探针（5.5 分钟、19 次调用、首选入口一次 ok、最终回答如实声明经首选入口交付）；相关测试 222 项（docs/specs/commits/environment/packaging）与相邻回归 816 项全绿；三次相关提交的 Git Gate 机械预检均通过后落库。覆盖：同一环境、同一发行物、同一自然指令的修复前后对照。事件形状补充实测（2026-07-31）：SessionStart 四个 source（startup/resume/clear/compact）全部 ok；SubagentStart 标准形状 ok（交付 3981 字引导）、缺 cwd 按契约返回 unavailable、多余 source 被忽略仍 ok——事件形状覆盖已补齐。未覆盖范围：其它 AI 环境的行为复测；部署件被应用更新覆盖后的长期稳定性。","updated_at":"2026-08-16T21:42:45.620720Z"},"excerpts":[],"match_reasons":[{"kind":"status","field_path":"status"}],"source_refs":[{"kind":"rule","locator":"specs/23-Pitfall-踩坑经验.md","details":{"responsibility_key":"pitfall-fact-type","path":"specs/23-Pitfall-踩坑经验.md","heading_path":null,"start_line":1,"end_line":242,"rule_source_view":"working_tree","git_worktree_root":"/Users/dmh2002/poker_hud_projects/ld-vibe-harness-v4/.cindy-worktrees/swift-mendel"}},{"kind":"working_tree","locator":"/Users/dmh2002/poker_hud_projects/ld-vibe-harness-v4/.cindy-worktrees/swift-mendel/ldvh-base/pitfalls/pitfall-01KZXN5TXNE1DAN6Z2NGRXZHYB.yaml","observed_at":"2026-08-16T23:09:20.719882Z","details":{"view":"Working Tree"}}]},{"fact_ref":{"object_uid":"019ffb52-ebb5-719c-b88e-30877858aac1"},"card_layer":"F2","fields":{"object_uid":"019ffb52-ebb5-719c-b88e-30877858aac1","object_id":"pitfall-01KZXN5TXNE6EBH3HGGXW5HAP1","title":"ZCode 插件 Hook 注册后需在环境设置中启用/信任才能实时触发","status":"active","symptoms":"1. 插件已部署到用户级插件目录，~/.zcode/plugins/ 中有完整文件结构\n2. 启动日志中报告 hookCount:1，证明 Hook 已注册\n3. data 文件（ldvh.json）完整，手动执行 hook 脚本可返回 work-context\n4. 新会话中没有 hook_run_started/hook_run_completed 记录\n5. 执行目录为空，无 Hook 执行产物\n6. 会话中可能出现 work-context，但来自 hydrate 恢复而非实时触发","trigger_conditions":"1. 通过 filesystem 方式部署 ZCode 插件，插件 manifest 声明了 SessionStart Hook\n2. 插件文件已安装到正确目录，enabledPlugins 已启用\n3. 验证者只检查了文件存在、Hook 注册日志和手动脚本可执行性\n4. 未检查 ZCode 设置中该插件的 Hook 是否已被信任/允许执行\n5. 目标环境（ZCode）将插件部署和 Hook 信任分离为两个独立步骤","scope_of_impact":"ZCode 环境中的插件部署、Hook 注册与信任检查；环境技能文件部署验证","applicability":"适用于通过 filesystem 方式在 ZCode 中安装 LDVH 插件的场景：插件已部署到用户级插件目录、Hook 已注册、data 文件完整、手动脚本可执行，但新会话未触发实时 Hook。它不说明通过 ZCode 官方插件市场分发、或其他 AI 环境（如 Trae CN、Codex、Cursor）的信任机制，也不适用于无法通过环境设置手动启用/信任插件的场景。","validation_summary":"2026-07-26 在 ZCode 完成两轮验证的对比：\n\n第一次安装（2026-07-24）：\n- 资产完整性：初始失败（data 目录缺 ldvh.json），后补全\n- 可执行性：手动脚本可返回 work-context\n- 实时触发：未通过，已注册 Hook 但无 hook_run_started/hook_run_completed\n- 结论：误以为 data 补全即可修复，未检查环境设置中 Hook 信任状态\n\n第二次重装（2026-07-26）：\n- 按 README 指引完成安装后，先在 ZCode 设置中确认插件已启用、Hook 已被信任\n- 启动新的 cold startup 会话\n- 实时触发：通过，启动日志中出现 hook_run_started/hook_run_completed，执行目录有对应产物\n- 完整接入声明：SessionStart 已 verified\n\n对比两轮结果，确认第一次失败的根因是：Hook 已注册但未在 ZCode 设置中被信任/允许执行，而非 Data 文件完整性问题。","updated_at":"2026-08-16T21:42:45.620720Z"},"excerpts":[],"match_reasons":[{"kind":"status","field_path":"status"}],"source_refs":[{"kind":"rule","locator":"specs/23-Pitfall-踩坑经验.md","details":{"responsibility_key":"pitfall-fact-type","path":"specs/23-Pitfall-踩坑经验.md","heading_path":null,"start_line":1,"end_line":242,"rule_source_view":"working_tree","git_worktree_root":"/Users/dmh2002/poker_hud_projects/ld-vibe-harness-v4/.cindy-worktrees/swift-mendel"}},{"kind":"working_tree","locator":"/Users/dmh2002/poker_hud_projects/ld-vibe-harness-v4/.cindy-worktrees/swift-mendel/ldvh-base/pitfalls/pitfall-01KZXN5TXNE6EBH3HGGXW5HAP1.yaml","observed_at":"2026-08-16T23:09:20.719995Z","details":{"view":"Working Tree"}}]},{"fact_ref":{"object_uid":"019ffb52-ebb5-76c1-bf82-3e69c790f6b0"},"card_layer":"F2","fields":{"object_uid":"019ffb52-ebb5-76c1-bf82-3e69c790f6b0","object_id":"pitfall-01KZXN5TXNEV0VZ0HYD73S1XNG","title":"Trae CN 环境接入：通过 hooks.json 部署 LDVH 插件","status":"active","symptoms":"1. LDVH 核心已通过 pip install -e 安装，但 AI 会话启动时未自动收到 LDVH 规则引导\n2. 手动调用 ldvh-work-context 可以返回规则内容，但新开会话后 AI 仍然不知道 LDVH 的存在\n3. 项目中有完整的 specs/ 规范目录，但 AI 每次都需要 Human 提示才去读取\n4. 已安装 LDVH 但子代理（subagent）启动时没有上下文恢复\n5. 尝试参考 code/plugins/ldvh/ 的 Codex hooks.json 格式配置，发现 Trae CN 不兼容","trigger_conditions":"1. 目标环境是 Trae CN（非 Trae Solo），通过本地 filesystem 部署插件\n2. LDVH 核心已通过 .venv/bin/pip install -e 安装\n3. 尝试复用 code/plugins/ldvh/hooks/hooks.json（Codex 格式）失败\n4. 目标环境存在 ~/.trae-cn/hooks.json 机制，但需要正确的 wrapper 脚本路径和 JSON 格式\n5. 插件数据目录和 wrapper 脚本默认放在 /tmp/ 下，重启后丢失","scope_of_impact":"Trae 环境中的 LDVH 插件部署、hooks.json 配置与接入验证","applicability":"适用于在 Trae CN IDE 中通过本地 filesystem 插件方式接入 LDVH 的场景：LDVH 核心已安装在项目 .venv 中，需要通过 Trae CN 的 ~/.trae-cn/hooks.json 机制注册 SessionStart 和 SubagentStart 事件，使 AI 会话启动时自动注入 LDVH 规则引导。它不说明其他 AI 环境（如 Codex、Cursor、Windsurf 等）的接入方式，也不适用于通过 Trae CN 官方插件市场分发或远程安装的场景。","validation_summary":"2026-07-26 在 Trae CN 环境完成以下验证：\n\n1. 静态部署：插件 manifest、wrapper 脚本、配置数据已部署到 ~/.trae-cn/plugins/ldvh/1.0.0/\n2. hooks.json：SessionStart 和 SubagentStart 均已注册，指向持久化 wrapper 脚本\n3. 核心直调：通过 wrapper 脚本模拟 SessionStart 事件，成功调用 ldvh-work-context 核心，返回 8.系统级运行架构 + 8.1渐进式披露 + 8.2薄引用 规则引导\n4. 插件注册：已注册到 installed-plugins.json 和 plugin-config.json 并启用\n\n该分层验证分别覆盖了资产完整性、Hook 注册、手动可执行性和实时触发（直调）。真实 Trae 会话启动时的自动触发尚未经新窗口验证，保持 unverified。","updated_at":"2026-08-16T21:42:45.620720Z"},"excerpts":[],"match_reasons":[{"kind":"status","field_path":"status"}],"source_refs":[{"kind":"rule","locator":"specs/23-Pitfall-踩坑经验.md","details":{"responsibility_key":"pitfall-fact-type","path":"specs/23-Pitfall-踩坑经验.md","heading_path":null,"start_line":1,"end_line":242,"rule_source_view":"working_tree","git_worktree_root":"/Users/dmh2002/poker_hud_projects/ld-vibe-harness-v4/.cindy-worktrees/swift-mendel"}},{"kind":"working_tree","locator":"/Users/dmh2002/poker_hud_projects/ld-vibe-harness-v4/.cindy-worktrees/swift-mendel/ldvh-base/pitfalls/pitfall-01KZXN5TXNEV0VZ0HYD73S1XNG.yaml","observed_at":"2026-08-16T23:09:20.720016Z","details":{"view":"Working Tree"}}]},{"fact_ref":{"object_uid":"019ffb52-ebb5-777b-99f4-543318c03fc1"},"card_layer":"F2","fields":{"object_uid":"019ffb52-ebb5-777b-99f4-543318c03fc1","object_id":"pitfall-01KZXN5TXNEXXSKX2M6CCC0FY1","title":"将项目 worktree 误作 workspace_root 会误报配置缺失","status":"active","symptoms":"Helper 返回 config_status=missing 与 scope_status=scope_unknown，并说明未选择任何 governed-projects configuration；但父工作区实际存在有效的 LDVH-GOVERNED-PROJECTS.yaml，且当前项目已在其中登记。","trigger_conditions":"调用管辖解析或依赖其结果的事实读取操作时，显式传入 workspace_root；该值是项目 Git worktree 根，而 LDVH-GOVERNED-PROJECTS.yaml 位于父工作区根。","scope_of_impact":"LDVH 环境接入时检查或配置 worktree 定位、workspace_root 传递","applicability":"适用于 LDVH Helper 的 workspace_root 被显式指定，且该目录本身不含 LDVH-GOVERNED-PROJECTS.yaml、配置位于上级工作区目录的场景。它不适用于配置确实不存在、配置无效或冲突，或 Human 有意选择另一个 workspace root 的情况。","validation_summary":"2026-07-30 在 ld-vibe-harness-v4 实际验证：1) 显式 workspace_root=/Users/dmh2002/poker_hud_projects/ld-vibe-harness-v4 时，Helper 返回 config_status=missing；2) 该目录的父目录实际存在 LDVH-GOVERNED-PROJECTS.yaml，并登记 ldvh 项目指向当前 worktree；3) 不传 workspace_root、仅提供当前 worktree locator 后，Helper 自动发现父目录配置并返回 config_status=valid、scope_status=governed_single。验证覆盖当前配置位置与当前 Helper 版本；不证明所有安装布局或未来配置发现实现都具有相同行为。","updated_at":"2026-08-16T21:42:45.620720Z"},"excerpts":[],"match_reasons":[{"kind":"status","field_path":"status"}],"source_refs":[{"kind":"rule","locator":"specs/23-Pitfall-踩坑经验.md","details":{"responsibility_key":"pitfall-fact-type","path":"specs/23-Pitfall-踩坑经验.md","heading_path":null,"start_line":1,"end_line":242,"rule_source_view":"working_tree","git_worktree_root":"/Users/dmh2002/poker_hud_projects/ld-vibe-harness-v4/.cindy-worktrees/swift-mendel"}},{"kind":"working_tree","locator":"/Users/dmh2002/poker_hud_projects/ld-vibe-harness-v4/.cindy-worktrees/swift-mendel/ldvh-base/pitfalls/pitfall-01KZXN5TXNEXXSKX2M6CCC0FY1.yaml","observed_at":"2026-08-16T23:09:20.720030Z","details":{"view":"Working Tree"}}]},{"fact_ref":{"object_uid":"019ffb52-ebb5-7ec3-856b-149a2befc2a8"},"card_layer":"F2","fields":{"object_uid":"019ffb52-ebb5-7ec3-856b-149a2befc2a8","object_id":"pitfall-01KZXN5TXNFV1RATRMK8NYZGN8","title":"Claude Code 技能在 Cindy/Codex 环境中部署失败","status":"active","symptoms":"1. 按 Claude Code 标准文档将技能文件部署为 ~/.claude/skills/<name>.md 后，重启 Claude Code\n   会话看不到技能。\n2. /skill 命令返回 Unknown command，而原生 Claude Code 环境应能识别。\n3. 技能文件存在于文件系统中，但 Claude Code 启动时未加载。\n4. 在 Cindy/Codex 环境中，codex-home/skills/ 目录下的 symlink 指向的目录中有技能文件，\n   但根目录 .md 文件不被识别。\n","trigger_conditions":"前置条件组合：（1）通过 Cindy/Codex 环境启动 Claude Code（非原生 Claude Code 可执行文件）；\n（2）技能部署为 ~/.claude/skills/<name>.md 扁平文件格式；（3）未将技能部署到 ~/.codex/skills/\n或 ~/.agents/skills/ 目录的目录格式路径。已观察条件：Cindy 的 Pi 文档明确说明 ~/.agents/skills/\n和 .agents/skills/ 中根目录 .md 文件被忽略，只有包含 SKILL.md 的子目录才被识别。未知条件：\nCindy/Codex 其他版本（如 2.0.x 或 3.x）是否采用相同规则；是否还有其他隐藏的技能扫描路径。\n","scope_of_impact":"跨平台技能文件部署、Skill 路径配置与加载验证","applicability":"适用于 Cindy/Codex 环境下运行 Claude Code 的用户。该环境通过 codex-home/skills/ 下的 symlink 链\n加载技能，技能发现规则为目录格式（<skill-name>/SKILL.md），而非原生 Claude Code 的扁平 .md 文件\n格式。不适用于原生 Claude Code 环境或使用 Claude Code 标准技能路径 ~/.claude/skills/ 的场景。\n","validation_summary":"2026-08-06 验证：将 ldvh 技能从 ~/.claude/skills/ldvh.md（扁平格式）迁移到\n~/.codex/skills/ldvh/SKILL.md（目录格式）后，重启全新会话，技能可见。/skill 命令可正常响应，\n不再返回 Unknown command。已观察环境：Windows，Cindy/Codex 2.1.219，Pi 0.83.0。未覆盖范围：\n其他操作系统（macOS/Linux）上的 Cindy/Codex 行为未知；Cindy/Codex 版本升级后技能发现规则\n是否变化未知。\n","updated_at":"2026-08-16T21:42:45.620720Z"},"excerpts":[],"match_reasons":[{"kind":"status","field_path":"status"}],"source_refs":[{"kind":"rule","locator":"specs/23-Pitfall-踩坑经验.md","details":{"responsibility_key":"pitfall-fact-type","path":"specs/23-Pitfall-踩坑经验.md","heading_path":null,"start_line":1,"end_line":242,"rule_source_view":"working_tree","git_worktree_root":"/Users/dmh2002/poker_hud_projects/ld-vibe-harness-v4/.cindy-worktrees/swift-mendel"}},{"kind":"working_tree","locator":"/Users/dmh2002/poker_hud_projects/ld-vibe-harness-v4/.cindy-worktrees/swift-mendel/ldvh-base/pitfalls/pitfall-01KZXN5TXNFV1RATRMK8NYZGN8.yaml","observed_at":"2026-08-16T23:09:20.720041Z","details":{"view":"Working Tree"}}]},{"fact_ref":{"object_uid":"01a00741-c69b-7b14-b640-af1394cd39af"},"card_layer":"F2","fields":{"object_uid":"01a00741-c69b-7b14-b640-af1394cd39af","object_id":"pitfall-01M03M3HMVFCABCG5F2EACTEDF","title":"子代理指定模型但未指定 provider 时继承宿主路由导致启动失败","status":"active","symptoms":"在 DeepSeek Harness Web 会话中执行\"用 subagent_deepseek_v4_pro 委派一个子代理报告它的模型身份\"，工具调用直接返回 Error: subagent run failed；会话代理改调 subagent_with_model 只传 model=deepseek-v4-pro 时同样失败。识别信号：父会话运行在 openai-codex/gpt-5.6-terra 路由上时子代理必然无法启动；自定义工具名（subagent_deepseek_v4_pro）在工具目录中时有时无——曾出现在自定义 preset 会话（04:39）中，随后在默认 preset 会话（04:47、04:53）中消失，profile 补丁写入后新会话仍看不到。","trigger_conditions":"前置条件组合：(1) 使用 DeepSeek Harness（dsh web profile，含 @aaravarr/dsh-subagent-max 0.1.1 bundle）；(2) 父会话运行在无法服务目标模型的 provider 路由上（如 openai-codex 只服务 codex 系模型），settings.yaml 默认模型为 openai-codex/gpt-5.6-terra；(3) 调用 subagent_with_model 时只指定 model、省略 provider，或把\"注册指定模型专用工具\"寄托在 profile 层 cordis.patch.yml 上。已观察条件：上述路由组合的会话中必然命中；dsh web profile 下 profile 补丁无法向 agent preset 合成层插入工具行。未知条件：其它宿主（Cindy/Trae 等）或其它 profile 组合是否同样命中，未逐一验证。","scope_of_impact":"子代理模型选择、provider 配置、跨环境路由继承","applicability":"适用边界：DeepSeek Harness（dsh web profile）及使用 dsh-subagent-max 类\"可选 provider/model\"子代理工具的宿主环境中为子代理指定模型路由的场景；以及任何\"想通过 profile/patch 层给 agent preset 增加工具行\"的场景。观察环境：DeepSeek Harness Web GUI（dsh web）、settings.yaml 默认 openai-codex/gpt-5.6-terra、dsh-subagent-max 0.1.1、2026-08-16。不适用：目标模型与父会话同 provider 的委派（无需改 provider）；preset 层自身的内容质量问题。","validation_summary":"已观察结果：(1) 修复前对照：04:47 与 04:53 两个失败会话中代理调用 subagent_with_model 仅带 model=deepseek-v4-pro，均返回 subagent run failed；两会话工具目录均无 subagent_deepseek_v4_pro；(2) 修复后验证：同一环境显式 provider=deepseek-official + model=deepseek-v4-pro 委派两次均成功，子代理自报 deepseek-v4-pro，并自读 DSH_SESSION_JSONL 确认 request/header config 为 provider=deepseek-official、model=deepseek-v4-pro；(3) 组合层实证：4 个 bundle 补丁 + profile 补丁按序组合出的 root 树不含 delegation 组与自定义工具，insert 补丁不生效并产生启动告警。覆盖：同一 dsh web 环境、同一宿主路由、同一目标模型的修复前后对照，以及 root 组合树的离线实证。未覆盖范围：其它宿主环境（Cindy/Trae）的 provider 继承与 preset 挂载行为；父会话 provider 恰为 deepseek-official 时省略 provider 也能成功（本经验仍建议显式化以消除路由歧义）。","updated_at":"2026-08-16T21:42:45.620720Z"},"excerpts":[],"match_reasons":[{"kind":"status","field_path":"status"}],"source_refs":[{"kind":"rule","locator":"specs/23-Pitfall-踩坑经验.md","details":{"responsibility_key":"pitfall-fact-type","path":"specs/23-Pitfall-踩坑经验.md","heading_path":null,"start_line":1,"end_line":242,"rule_source_view":"working_tree","git_worktree_root":"/Users/dmh2002/poker_hud_projects/ld-vibe-harness-v4/.cindy-worktrees/swift-mendel"}},{"kind":"working_tree","locator":"/Users/dmh2002/poker_hud_projects/ld-vibe-harness-v4/.cindy-worktrees/swift-mendel/ldvh-base/pitfalls/pitfall-01M03M3HMVFCABCG5F2EACTEDF.yaml","observed_at":"2026-08-16T23:09:20.720049Z","details":{"view":"Working Tree"}}]}],"coverage":{"status":"complete","total_matching":6,"returned":6,"offset":0,"next_cursor":null,"object_set_fingerprint":"1e7ccdc9c63cd992f4e919a31961e0a675f30c8b6841684aec0d114ab74dfc75"}},"scope":{"requested":[{"governed_project_id":"ldvh","card_layer":"F2","fact_type_key":"adr"},{"governed_project_id":"ldvh","card_layer":"F2","fact_type_key":"pitfall"},{"governed_project_id":"ldvh","card_layer":"F2","fact_type_key":"spark"},{"governed_project_id":"ldvh","card_layer":"F2","fact_type_key":"study"},{"governed_project_id":"ldvh","card_layer":"F2","fact_type_key":"workcase"}],"completed":[{"governed_project_id":"ldvh","card_layer":"F2","fact_type_key":"adr"},{"governed_project_id":"ldvh","card_layer":"F2","fact_type_key":"pitfall"},{"governed_project_id":"ldvh","card_layer":"F2","fact